EventSlide also relies on third-party components that stay under their own
licences. Notably:

  - sharp (Apache-2.0), for image processing. It loads libvips as shipped in
    the @img/sharp-libvips-* packages (LGPL-3.0-or-later).
  - ffmpeg (GPL; Debian's build enables libx264), for short video clips. It is
    installed with apt in the runtime stage of the Dockerfile and run as a
    separate process, never linked into EventSlide.

This list is not exhaustive: every other dependency is declared in
package-lock.json together with its own licence.
